WEBVTT

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.150
Hey, Marco. Can I stop by
your place after school?

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.150
Sure, that's fine. Ah...

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.450
Sasha! Conny!

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.990
It's rare to see you two going home together.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.830
Conny told me that he found a good ramen place.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.910
Just thinking about it makes me wanna drool.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.620
You already are drooling.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.540
Come on, let's go already!

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:25.670
Yeah!

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.250
Oh, Franz!

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.380
Hanna!

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.340
Hanna! Franz!

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.510
You guys are all lovey-dovey
as usual, you dumb couple.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.260
Wh-What? <i>Us</i>, a married couple?

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.390
You're getting ahead of yourself, Jean!

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.520
Now, let's go, Franz.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:42.350
Yeah, Hanna.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.440
Anyway...

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:46.650
...don't you think your hair's too long?

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.610
It could cause an accident during
the gear training, you know.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.360
All right. I'll cut it.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.070
You bastard! I'm so jealous!

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:55.910
Huh?!

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.790
Let go of me! You're gonna tear my uniform!

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.040
Hey, Mikasa! Put me down!

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.710
I'm not your little brother or your kid!

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.630
Now, now, calm down, Jean.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:11.340
Geez... Aren't there any girls
who appreciate my char—

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.680
Wh-What's the matter, Jean?!

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:15.010
I'm in love with you.
I'm always watching you.
Wh-What's the matter, Jean?!

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:15.220
I'm in love with you.
I'm always watching you.

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:18.430
I'm in love with you. I'm always watching you.
I'm in love with you.
I'm always watching you.

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:18.640
I'm in love with you.
I'm always watching you.

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.980
Period 6
Love Letter! Titan Junior High School

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.440
Morning!

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.360
Ah, Eren.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.740
Good morni—

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.490
Whoa! That's one serious bedhead!

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.490
I went to bed right after
I took a bath last night.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:08.500
Geez... This is why you're still a kid.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:11.920
You kids don't know how to present yourselves.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:16.800
Hey, hey, Jean. What's up with that hairstyle?

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:18.760
Hm...? What's this smell?

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:22.970
I guess a kid wouldn't get it.
It's cologne. Co-lo-gne!

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.180
I smell a bathroom air freshener.

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:28.600
Huh? Oh, you wanna know why I'm so cool?

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:29.520
- Well, not really...

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:32.360
- I see! Since you're so insistent, I guess I'll tell you.
- Well, not really...

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.940
It's because of...

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.280
...this!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.490
A love letter?!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:38.570
No way! It's for you, Jean?!

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.990
But the letter isn't signed.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:44.030
Then you can't dismiss the possibility
that someone's playing a prank, huh?

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:47.410
Don't be ridiculous! I'm sure she's just shy!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.250
I guess he just wanted to brag.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.080
Good morning.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:52.920
Hey.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:55.170
Cool hairdo.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:57.670
I'm in love with you.
I'm always watching you.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.800
"I'm always watching you," huh?
I'm in love with you.
I'm always watching you.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:00.090
"I'm always watching you," huh?

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:04.430
Wait a sec! Does it mean that
the sender of this letter is nearby?

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.310
Who on earth is it?

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:08.140
Good morning!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:11.270
Hey! You're early today.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.610
- I woke up 'cause I was hungry.
- Could it be Sasha?! Was she putting on an act earlier?

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:14.650
- Oh, I understand.
- Could it be Sasha?! Was she putting on an act earlier?

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:17.400
- Fried chicken was in my dream this morning.
- No, there's no way that that potato girl can write a girlie letter!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.610
- Oh, I wish I had a dream like that.
- No, there's no way that that potato girl can write a girlie letter!

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:23.200
- Well, my mom almost ate it, though.
- But wait... Is it possible...?

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:27.200
Jean! Let's go on a lunch date!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.790
Sure. With you, I feel like I can eat a lot.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.130
Another bowl, please!

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.380
Hey!

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:39.090
No! She'd spend everything I had on food!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:39.970
Good morning, Sasha!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.840
Good morning!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.930
Christa!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:44.800
- She's elegant and cute.
She perfectly fits the impression of the letter.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.680
- Ah, I have something I wanna give to you today.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:51.270
Could it possibly be her?!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:53.600
Sorry, Sasha!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.520
Christa?!

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:58.610
Jean... I...

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:01.190
- Here, I got some Chinsuko as a souvenir for you.
- Oh, it's my sweet goddess.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:02.200
- Are you God?!
- Oh, it's my sweet goddess.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.030
Are you... God?!

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.490
Hey, potato girl!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.330
- Get yer paws off my Christa already!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:10.410
- Ymir... She's boyish. It can't possibly be her, right?
- Get yer paws off my Christa already!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.620
God!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:16.630
But if she had written a letter like that,
well, it wouldn't be so ba—

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:23.220
My dear Christa... Sorry about this...

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:26.180
...but I'm the one who's gonna marry Jean.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:32.980
Argh! Now every girl
in the class looks suspicious!

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:35.810
Jean, after school today...

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.690
Jean! I need to talk to you
about club activities.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.480
Whoa!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.480
Jean's mine!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.150
He's mine!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.780
Excuse me!

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:47.620
Sorry, I'm your upperclassman, so...

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.620
Whoa! Petra!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.830
R-Rico!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.160
Jean...

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:58.000
I'm always tough on you,
but to tell you the truth...

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:06.090
- Jean's mine!
- Let him go!
- He's mine!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.640
There are just too many to pick from!

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.180
What should I do?!

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.480
What the hell is his problem?

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:16.350
- I'm scared.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.690
- What should I do?!

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:22.650
Hey, Jean. You're getting
caught up in a fantasy world.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.860
Your face looks terrible
and you're breathing hard.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:27.530
Your brain's definitely having a problem.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:31.030
Wait... if, by some chance,
it wasn't any of them, then...

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.370
Mikasa?

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:36.620
No, can't be! That'd be too good to be...

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.420
Actually, yeah, I can see that.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:39.710
Creepy!

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:40.920
Uhm...

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.050
Annie?!

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:46.550
I need to talk to you.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.220
Could it be her?!

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:49.260
What is it?

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.050
I need to talk to him.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:54.430
I'll give him the message. What is it?

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.690
Thanks, but I'll tell him myself.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.310
It's no trouble at all.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.520
It's no trouble for <i>me</i>, either.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.730
It's pretty crowded
in the classroom in the morning,

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:08.070
so moving around can be a pain.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:13.160
We don't have to worry about that,
right, Mikasa? Because for some reason...

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.080
...there's no one around us.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.910
The dream match is happening again!

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.870
Women are scary!

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:24.630
Hey, hey. Just how many
conflicts am I causing? I'm so sinful.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:25.260
- What's going on?

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:26.460
- That's enough.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.510
I'm done listening.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:30.340
It's pointless.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.800
Hold on a sec!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:35.100
Stop it... Don't fight over—

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:47.990
Th-This is...

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.910
...the same kind of envelope
that my love letter was in?!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.040
Wha—

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.460
- What the hell is going on?
- There are seven 3 to 4 meter high Titans in the supply room.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.630
You just brought down five of them.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.300
How many Titans are left? Eren Jaeger!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.130
Yes, sir! I'll drive them all away!

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.510
- Could it really be...?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.010
- Go stand in the hallway!

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.310
Fried chicken's good, too.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:20.100
Yeah, I found it in front of the station, but...

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:23.230
Is Annie the one who wrote me the letter?

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:26.320
I want you to listen to me
without getting upset.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.860
You aren't popular among girls,

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.700
- so you should face the reality of the situation.

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:31.820
- Shut up!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.490
Oh?

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.120
What's she doing?

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.500
Annie!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:43.330
That's your shoe locker, right, Jean?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:46.630
Is it possible that Annie really likes Jean?

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:48.960
Come to think of it...

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:53.470
Wh-What I like to eat for lunch is...

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.050
Bring it on!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:58.140
Mikasa... I won't let you have...

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.390
...Jean!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.730
He clearly made up some parts
of that conversation, didn't he?

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:05.190
Ah! The letter!

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:12.950
Please come to Attack Park after school.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:24.960
Here it comes!

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:30.710
Today is the beginning... of my sweet life!

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:31.800
Yeah!

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:33.380
He must be really happy.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.050
- I'm coming! Annie!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:37.010
- Well, his glory days are finally here, so...

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:38.890
Hey...

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:41.560
Annie?! You didn't go to the park?!

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:44.980
Well, I wanted to talk to you this morning.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:49.110
I want some advice about that love letter.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.330
Did you wait long?

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.990
A-Annie!

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.460
So it was you who wrote that letter?

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.620
W-Well, I guess.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:07.790
I was surprised.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:12.090
Is it possible that you did this, that,
and the other thing to get my attention?

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.920
Th-That may be the case.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:19.050
I get how you feel about me. So...

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:24.560
...if you really insist,
I could go out with you.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:28.100
Of course, a guy like me is very popular.

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:32.400
But you mustered up the courage
to write me a love letter, so...

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:33.780
Wha—?!

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:37.110
What?! Already? I need more time to prepare!

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:39.870
Ow!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:45.620
Forget it. I was trying to be nice,
but you pushed your luck too far.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.290
What do you mean?

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.250
When I talked to Eren and the others about this,

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:52.090
they said I should just
wait and see so I did, but...

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.130
Ah! You bastards!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:55.970
Those letters are from my friend.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.880
Y-Your friend?

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.800
I'll call her out here.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:15.780
A-Annie? What the hell are you doing?

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.910
A-A Titan's coming!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:31.380
Wh-What the hell is going on?

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.540
The letters are from her.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:37.090
She asked me to write them for her, that's all.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:39.180
Wh-Whaaaaaat?!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:42.260
Hold on a sec!
Why are you friends with a Titan?!

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:43.550
We go to the same cram school.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.220
That's some cram school!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.230
You can understand the Titan language?

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.520
I'm learning it at the cram school.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:50.100
That's some cram school!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:53.520
So... she's very shy and cute.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.360
I want you to go out with her.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:57.360
Shy...

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:59.150
...and cute...

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.360
Blushing.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.030
No way!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.990
But why Jean?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:11.460
She told me that he gave his lunch
to her in this park when she was hungry.

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:16.590
Ah! That time! When we
ran away from a Titan the other day!

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.380
There'll be a quiz in English class today.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.130
Seriously?!

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:24.050
A-A Titan!

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:25.350
Run!

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.100
Marco!

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:28.560
Jean! Run! Now!

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:30.020
Don't be ridiculous!

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:31.390
Oh, that's right!

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.110
Take... this!

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.400
Now! Run!

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:41.240
Blushing.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:46.580
She said she can't forget
about that omelet rice lunch.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.200
I'm happy for you, Jean!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.040
Why don't you just go out with her?

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.040
You two will make a nice couple.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.250
This can't be happening.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.250
There's no way that my
first love letter was from...

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.920
...a Titan...

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:03.220
That can't be... That can't be...!

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.720
That's not a Titan.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:06.430
What?!

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:07.930
What're you saying, Jean?!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.350
Was the shock so big that you lost it?

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.850
She's clearly human.

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.440
See? She's shorter than me.

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:17.570
Anyway you look at it, she's bigger!

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:23.990
See? We can hold each other's hands, too.

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:26.320
Come on, my honey.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.000
Jean! Stop it.

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.630
You can't go on like this!

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.840
Face the reality of the situation! Jean!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:43.090
Was I trying to live in a dream or fantasy?

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:46.590
I must've known the reality.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:52.140
If you think about it,
you'd easily know that you can't go out...

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.560
...with a huge woman like that!

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.270
Jean!

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.320
She says that she won't give up.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:09.990
Hey, are you okay?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.330
I'm starting to kinda feel sorry for Jean.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:17.790
I'll let him experience
what it's like to be popular.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.590
I'm Daikon! I'm in season right now!

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.510
Eat me while I'm white and firm!

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.930
Don't be ridiculous! I, Curry Bread,
have beautifully tanned skin, and I'm filling, too!

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:29.800
I'm a better fit for Mr. Jean!

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.510
Argh! What'd you say?!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:32.640
What the hell is this?

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:37.440
I know Jean isn't popular,
but this is too stupid to—

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.360
Jean! Grate me!

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:47.030
Eat me, Mr. Jean!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.620
- Mr. Jean!
- Jean!

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:53.080
H-Hey, hey, don't fight over me.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:56.460
I'll make both of you my girlfriends.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.380
I'm glad that you liked it.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.540
Hey, let's go home.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.130
Yeah.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:08.050
Ah, time for cram school.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:08.970
- Jean, I love you!

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:10.640
- Marco, let's go.
- Jean, I love you!

00:15:10.850 --> 00:15:14.350
Yeah, but I'll wait for Jean
to come back to reality first.

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>climb over that wall</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.200
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.700
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:39.420
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.510
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:00.190
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.730
<i>Even if our glory days of youth</i>
<i>get trampled upon,</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:16.240
<i>I won't give in to that</i>
<i>absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.340
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:33.140
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:49.400
There are rules all students have had to follow.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.660
When the rift that divides
upperclassmen and underclassmen

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.820
grows larger than ever,

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.990
Eren ends up having to battle it out
with Levi and the other upperclassmen.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.790
Showdown! Titan Junior High School
